        },
        {
          "text": "The artifacts should include prompts, scaffolds, and templates that can be used in the early stages of deliberate practice, as well as tools for setting effective goals and evaluating progress towards those goals.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 71,
          "source": "SRL-starter-sheet-and-prompt.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "The artifacts should also incorporate metacognitive strategies to improve comprehension and retention of information from complex academic texts, and should be designed to keep my motivation and self-efficacy high throughout the learning process.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 72,
          "source": "SRL-starter-sheet-and-prompt.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "The artifacts should be organized in a way that allows for easy access and use, and should be designed to facilitate the feedback loop between the Forethought Phase and the Self-Reflection Phase, allowing me to continuously improve my learning process over time.",
